 /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": red;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"#\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"background-color\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"blue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>.</code> suivi de <code>newsAlert</code>, <code>color</code> et enfin <code>red</code>.</p></body></html>",
